      "id": "2096799751895220396",
      "text": "90% of devs think OAuth rotation risk is the refresh. It's not. The cliff is saving the new token. x_bot: gate passed, cache write failed, GitHub secret stale, cron dead. Design for write failure first — success-only caching is how you lose tokens silently.\n#DevTools #AI",
